      "principle": "other: reversibility as a precautionary decision rule",
      "turn": 1,
      "quote": "the league should keep the rule it has now, review it in a year with her input",
      "use": "correct",
      "note": "It favors a revisable interim decision while evidence and views remain contested, though it leaves the review criteria unclear."
    }
  ],
